        "func": "if(msg.payload.content == \"What is the temperature in Milan?\"){\n    return [msg, null]\n}\nelse {\n    msg.payload.content = \"I don't get what you're asking...\";\n}\ndelete msg.ts;\ndelete msg.transport;\nmsg.payload.inbound = false;\nmsg.payload.fallback = null;\n\nreturn [null, msg];",
